# v07.0: Auth tokens

Issue: #50

Every task route is open to anyone who can reach the process.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a request without a valid bearer token receives a 401

## Findings

- The control row. It sits on the board rather than the backlog, so a triage
  never files it.

> Test strategy: unit, call a route with no token and with a valid one.
